'''Replica Rumi's Concoction''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Granite Flask}}. It is the [[replica]] version of {{il|Rumi's Concoction}}.

==Modifiers==
By default, using this flask creates three Flask Buff icons:
# {{stl|Granite Flask}} (additional Armour)
# {{stl|Rumi's Concoction}} (chance to Block Attacks and Spells)
# {{stl|Replica Rumi's Concoction}} (Petrified) 

Similarly to being [[frozen]], [[petrified]] modifies the player's [[action speed]] by reducing it by 100%. Effects that prevent or minimize lowering of [[action speed]], like Trickster's {{psl|One Step Ahead}}, [[Juggernaut]]'s {{psl|Unstoppable}}, {{il|Kaom's Roots}}, or some [[Scourge modifier]]s, will prevent the player from being stuck in place and unable to use any skills during this flask's effect.

Replica Rumi's Concoction has an incredibly short duration; by default, with 0% [[quality]], the flask effect duration is 0.6 seconds. In order to improve its uptime, players will likely want to apply an {{il|Enkindling Orb}} for {{c|enchanted|(80-100)% increased Duration}}, or [[corrupted]] the flask to gain -10% to +10% quality on top of the quality from {{il|Glassblower's Bauble}}, to counteract the {{c|mod|90% reduced Duration}} modifier (stacks additively to the enchantment and multiplicative to flask quality). However, the enchantment will make the flask be unable to gain charges while active, making it primarily used as a burst of block-based defences.

{{item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 0.40 seconds instead.

